   "text": "\u2605 PC install-readiness poll\n\u2192 PC Orchestrator: QueryServersPaged\ncontent filter = install id + hash\nretry until a PC server reports it\n\u2192 NotifyReady",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "pcpoll",
   "originalText": "\u2605 PC install-readiness poll\n\u2192 PC Orchestrator: QueryServersPaged\ncontent filter = install id + hash\nretry until a PC server reports it\n\u2192 NotifyReady",
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
