   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1781801900000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "\u2460  SHARED BUILD\nPassing the StoreAsset gives xCloud the same ContentId +\nPackageFamilyName as the download / publish path: ingestion\nSourceid = StoreAsset.ContentId (contract-enforced equal). One\ningested SUCU (XUS) build is the shared streaming package.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "\u2460  SHARED BUILD\nPassing the StoreAsset gives xCloud the same ContentId +\nPackageFamilyName as the download / publish path: ingestion\nSourceid = StoreAsset.ContentId (contract-enforced equal). One\ningested SUCU (XUS) build is the shared streaming package.",
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
